  "_design_notes": [
    "ser-vs-estar gets 3 symmetric pairs — it's the sub that most rewards contrast drilling in BR-PT.",
    "perfeito vs imperfeito mirrors FR passé-composé vs imparfait.",
    "subjunctive pairs include the BR-specific futuro do subjuntivo (quando eu for, se ele quiser) contrasting with presente do subjuntivo (espero que ele venha) and imperfeito do subjuntivo (se eu pudesse).",
    "por-vs-para is the preposition contrast; em-vs-a is the location/destination contrast.",
    "gerundio-vs-infinitivo matters in BR (estou falando) because EU-PT forms (estou a falar) will be rejected in the seed bank but learners may confuse them.",
